  "markdown": "# Reader-Writer Lock\n\nWhere a [Mutex](../mutex/) only lets you take exclusive access even when a shared reference would have been enough, a Reader-Writer Lock (RwLock) lets you have one exclusive mutable reference OR multiple shared read references.\n\nAn RwLock is optimal for data that is read frequently but written to infrequently.\n",
